Darren's changes in vserion 0.5.13 (Nov.28):

- Fixed "String too long" error in intervt:
- Shortened intervt timeout from 10 to 2 seconds.
- Removed/cleaned up Jochen's debug code

Jochen's changes/bug fixes in version 0.5.12 (completed 20 Nov 1995):

- Added additional debugging aids with GLOBAL proc$(8) and LOCAL last$(8) 
  variables. proc$ holds the current procedure name, and last$ the last
  procedure name. 
  This is used with the error trap in the main loop to find which PROC 
  caused the error.
- Changed variable name ta% to ky% to be consistant with rest of FreeVT
- Added detection of changes in FreeVT settings. User now asked to
  save settings upon exit (if settings have changed).
- Changed dialog for handshaking to be consistant with Comms and added DCD
- Vthelp: now looks for files on M:, A: and B: before reporting file 
  not found. The freevt.rsc file can now be in \FVT\ on any drive.
- Added search procedure to look for the freelib.opo library file.
  The freelib.opo file can now be in \OPO\ on any drive.
- Corrected bug in the escape handling in vtmenu: for the serial port 
  settings dialog

Darren's changes in version 0.5.11:
- Finished adding support for line character set
- Removed duplicate sorry() procedure
- Removed extra local echo code (as result of an earlier merge)


Jochen's changes/bug fixes (Nov 8) in version 0.5.10:

1. Changed Darren's error handling in vthelp: to show standard error
   dialog.
2. Added LOCK ON/OFF to prevent a user from stopping a vt100 session
   from the system screen with delete (FreeVT could be online at the 
   time)
3. Added SETFILE and SETPATH to loadp: and savep: so that the system 
   screen name changes when the loaded file is changed
4. Changed some spaces to tab stops (smaller OPL file sizee :-) )
5. Improved some REM commenting in procedures I made
6. Changed GOTO to a DO...UNTIL in fiOvWr: procedure
7. Added error trapping to LOADM and opening COM port
8. Moved errdia: to freevt.opl Must be here due to error handlers!
9. Corrected Esc handling in recvfl:
10. Changed GIPRINT error messages to errdia: messages in sendfl: and 
    recvfi: (I know Darren, this is your area, but with these dialogs 
    the error stays on the screen so you can see it)
11. Changed dialogs in sendfl: and recvfl: to errdia: for consistancy
12. Removed space in "Connecting..." busy messages (for consistancy)
13. Corrected protocol menu text to be consistant with comms
14. Corrected send file dialog title and prompt to be consistant with comms
15. Corrected vthelp: call from transmit dialog to bring up correct help
    page
16. Changed the V in the version display to a v (I think it looks
    better)
17. Help file updated due to 16.


